<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <style>
        .container {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 40px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
        }
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .header h2 {
            color: #3266CC;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .content {
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333333;
        }
        .info-box {
            background-color: #f4f7f6;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 40px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #999999;
            text-align: center;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <img src="{{logoUrl}}" alt="Abittoenergy Logo" style="max-width: 200px; height: auto;" />
        </div>
        <div class="header">
            <h2>Meter Link Request Received</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Hello {{firstName}},</p>
            <p>We've received your request to link meter <strong>{{meterNumber}}</strong> to your Abittoenergy account.</p>
            <p>Our team is currently reviewing your request. We will notify you via email as soon as it has been processed.</p>
            
            <div class="info-box">
                <p><strong>Installation Details:</strong></p>
                <p>Estate: {{estateName}}</p>
                <p>House Number: {{houseNumber}}</p>
            </div>
            
            <p>If you have any questions in the meantime, please feel free to reach out to our support team.</p>
            
            <p>Best regards,<br>The Abittoenergy Team</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>&copy; 2026 Abittoenergy. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
